He didn't send them

00:03:29.842 --> 00:03:32.011
an invitation on parchment,
that said...

00:03:33.946 --> 00:03:36.415
Seriously, these people
are such fragile babies.

00:03:36.415 --> 00:03:37.550
He's the president.

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:39.385
You're telling me
voters ask him questions

00:03:39.385 --> 00:03:41.487
about his record is an ambush?

00:03:41.487 --> 00:03:43.155
You guys sound
like whiny teenagers

00:03:43.155 --> 00:03:45.224
who just got called
to a family meeting.

00:03:45.224 --> 00:03:48.494
Tyler, is this marijuana
I found in your bedroom?

00:03:48.494 --> 00:03:50.930
"You went in my room?!
This is an ambush!

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:53.066
I'm going to Scooch's
lake house for the weekend!

00:03:53.066 --> 00:03:54.266
I mean, I was going, anyway,

00:03:54.266 --> 00:03:55.634
but, now, I'm gonna use
this ambush excuse.

00:03:55.634 --> 00:03:57.536
Also, I need that weed
because [ Indistinct ]

00:03:57.536 --> 00:03:59.839
I promised Scooch and I feel
like it would be a big deal

00:03:59.839 --> 00:04:01.440
if I don't show up with weed.
What?

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:03.375
Oh, my God!
That's a "gotcha" question!"

00:04:03.375 --> 00:04:04.643
But the exchange
about healthcare

00:04:04.643 --> 00:04:06.111
and preexisting conditions led

00:04:06.111 --> 00:04:08.847
